poline rootfs after the VM exits by @choksi2212 in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1841\n* fix(runtime): honor custom filesystem backends by @x0day in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1899\n### Dependencies\n* chore(deps): Bump the \"dependencies\" group with 2 updates across multiple ecosystems by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1897\n### CI\n* ci: compress rust test debug sections by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1912\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh lockfiles after v0.7.9 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1905\n* chore: release v0.7.10 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1916\n\n## New Contributors\n* @choksi2212 made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1841\n* @lukaskoebe made their first contribution in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1900\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.9...v0.7.10","mentions_count":6}
